.TH show 1  "show " 
.SH NAME
show \- Inspect a detailed view of a resolved knowledge element
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshow\fR [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIELEMENT_ID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect a detailed view of a resolved knowledge element
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH INSPECTION
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
Display compact single\-line element summary
.TP
<\fIELEMENT_ID\fR>
Element ID (UUID or prefix) to display
